To create game descritions from excel files or generate an index of game descritions do this:

- goto project dir (where items, xlsx and cripts forlders are in)
- source venv/bin/activate
- goto scripts dir in spieleapp_content
- python scripts/xlsx_to_json.py xlsx/Test.xlsx 48

To generate the index:
- goto project dir (where items, xlsx and cripts forlders are in)
- source venv/bin/activate
- goto scripts dir in spieleapp_content
- python scripts/generate_index.py .
